{"card_hash": "d5e106ae255c86f1f295cb3aad1478f4c906e766389df0ce8db21272aa709474", "channel": "The AI Daily Brief: Artificial Intelligence News and Analysis", "chars": 34821, "chars_all_clips": 34821, "chars_chosen_clips": 1440, "clip_count": 37, "clips": [{"deep_link": "https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/nlw/episodes/What-a-30B-Hedge-Fund-Implosion-Really-Means-for-AI-e3mqdl5#t=143", "end": 195.82, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "b942af10c017519716012a066274e3d5cdb1a6bf71df44b899b4c15cd53919c2", "start": 143.02, "text": "Meanwhile, their data also showed that OpenAI was sitting just shy of $50 billion in ARR. Now, obviously, this data should be treated as a very rough estimate, but it seems directionally correct based on Fryer's comments. It also lines up w", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/nlw/episodes/What-a-30B-Hedge-Fund-Implosion-Really-Means-for-AI-e3mqdl5#t=489", "end": 541.9, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "d250cd3fae9d11fcf1b9def7afd9e0cd7da3180277abd3318e60e78bc9ed4a07", "start": 489.18, "text": "My position on that is pretty clear. However, very importantly, it is very easy for any of us who intersect primarily with one part or one theme of the market to think that that's the most important thing in markets. However, if you take a ", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/nlw/episodes/What-a-30B-Hedge-Fund-Implosion-Really-Means-for-AI-e3mqdl5#t=635", "end": 691.02, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "01304c4e881c670298530b7a1816f823be3e271092de741e67d452fa48b4f3eb", "start": 635.34, "text": "That's around 3.4% of the adult population. As many as 360,000 accounts were liquidated, meaning they were forced to sell after failing to meet a margin-called. It's always dangerous to try to say market moves are only about this thing vers", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/nlw/episodes/What-a-30B-Hedge-Fund-Implosion-Really-Means-for-AI-e3mqdl5#t=1120", "end": 1166.91, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "e6d9b3ef3bb9a938422b57fb18a75eb0c136f81ef696dfd82133af9bf724be8e", "start": 1120.03, "text": "Zuckerberg then listed options including enterprise AI, spinning off their internal productivity tools as separate products, and a constellation of new vibe code adapts. However, he acknowledged that these would all require Meta to flex a q", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/nlw/episodes/What-a-30B-Hedge-Fund-Implosion-Really-Means-for-AI-e3mqdl5#t=1220", "end": 1277.95, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "057f4f6cf2295c90c262ec4555d4ce2a7b0f572ce6f95a39b3c65cb61c7ab99a", "start": 1220.59, "text": "Among other effects, it gives the hyperscalers the latitude they need to hike spending to match rising costs and keep the AI trade rolling. The hyperscalers say the demand is still there and it's still rising, which brings us to perhaps the", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/nlw/episodes/What-a-30B-Hedge-Fund-Implosion-Really-Means-for-AI-e3mqdl5#t=1762", "end": 1826.03, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "4311eee56c60be6a64ba32688bf060bad8cf6384a13ca5b427c64dcd72e56bd8", "start": 1762.27, "text": "You may not be interested in politics, but politics is interested in you. That's kind of how I feel about AI markets for many of us who are here around the AI daily brief. Certainly some of you are professional investors, for whom this is a", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}], "current_topic": "Uncategorized", "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpts": [{"deep_link": "https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/nlw/episodes/What-a-30B-Hedge-Fund-Implosion-Really-Means-for-AI-e3mqdl5#t=143", "end": 195.82, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerp